title: "HarmonicFoldNet"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "XzStark"
abstract: >-
  A compact research implementation for cross-subject SSVEP decoding with
  candidate-aligned spectral evidence, foldable local temporal mixing,
  reduced-token harmonic attention, and optional low-parameter adaptation.
